3:T1027,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Vision Express offer a price match guarantee?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, Vision Express offers a price match guarantee on identical products. If you find the same frames and lenses cheaper at another optician, Vision Express will match the price. The product must be identical — same frame model, same lens type, and same lens coatings. You will need to provide proof of the competitor's price, such as a written quote or website listing."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is Vision Express's 30-day satisfaction guarantee?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Vision Express offers a 30-day satisfaction guarantee on all glasses purchased from their stores. If you are not completely happy with your new glasses within 30 days of collection, you can return them for an exchange or full refund. This applies to both frames and lenses and gives customers peace of mind when trying a new frame style or lens type."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Who owns Vision Express?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Vision Express is owned by EssilorLuxottica, the world's largest eyewear company, formed from the 2018 merger of French lens manufacturer Essilor and Italian frame maker Luxottica. EssilorLuxottica also owns brands such as Ray-Ban, Oakley, Persol, and Oliver Peoples, as well as retail chains including Sunglass Hut and LensCrafters. This ownership gives Vision Express access to an extensive range of premium and designer frames."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much do glasses cost at Vision Express?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Glasses prices at Vision Express vary depending on the frame and lens choice. Complete glasses packages start from around £49 for basic single-vision prescriptions with budget frames. Designer frames typically range from £100 to £300 or more, and premium lens upgrades such as varifocals, anti-reflection coatings, and photochromic lenses are available at additional cost. NHS vouchers can be applied towards the total price for eligible patients."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Vision Express do contact lenses?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, Vision Express offers a full contact lens service, including initial assessments, trial fittings, and ongoing supply. They stock a wide range of lenses from major manufacturers including Johnson & Johnson (Acuvue), Alcon (Dailies, Air Optix), and CooperVision. Monthly contact lens subscription plans are available, which include regular check-ups and lens delivery to your home."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I book a Vision Express appointment through eyetest.co.uk?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Vision Express is not currently available for direct booking through eyetest.co.uk. We include Vision Express on our platform so that customers can compare their services and prices with other opticians. To book an appointment, visit visionexpress.com or contact your local Vision Express store by phone. We hope to offer direct Vision Express booking in the future."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Vision Express offer free eye tests?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Vision Express provides free NHS-funded eye tests for all eligible patients. Eligibility criteria include being under 16, over 60, receiving qualifying benefits, having diabetes or glaucoma, or having a close family member with glaucoma if you are over 40. If you are not eligible for an NHS test, private eye tests start from £30."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How long does it take to get glasses from Vision Express?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Glasses from Vision Express typically take between 7 and 14 working days, depending on the complexity of your prescription and the lens options you choose. Simple single-vision prescriptions are usually at the faster end, while varifocals, high-index lenses, and specialty coatings may take a little longer. Vision Express will notify you by text or email when your glasses are ready for collection."}}]}0:{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","$L2",null,{}],["$","main",null,{"className":"flex-1","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Vision Express\",\"url\":\"https://www.visionexpress.com\",\"description\":\"Vision Express is a major UK optical chain owned by the EssilorLuxottica group, one of the world's largest eyewear companies. They offer a comprehensive range of eye tests, glasses, sunglasses, and contact lenses, with a strong emphasis on clinical excellence. Many of their stores are located in prominent high-street and retail park locations, and they carry an extensive portfolio of premium and designer frames.\",\"foundingDate\":\"1988\",\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"Country\",\"name\":\"United Kingdom\"},\"numberOfEmployees\":{\"@type\":\"QuantitativeValue\",\"name\":\"UK stores\",\"value\":400},\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.visionexpress.com\"],\"parentOrganization\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"eyetest.co.uk\",\"url\":\"https://www.eyetest.co.uk\"}}"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https://www.eyetest.co.uk\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Opticians\",\"item\":\"https://www.eyetest.co.uk/opticians\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Vision Express\",\"item\":\"https://www.eyetest.co.uk/opticians/vision-express\"}]}"}}],["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$3"}}],"$L4","$L5","$L6","$L7",false,"$L8","$L9","$La","$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le","$Lf"]}],"$L10"],["$L11"],"$L12"]}],"isPartial":false,"staleTime":300,"varyParams":null,"buildId":"ssq08EaNRRySny1_GDRUp"}
