5:["$","section",null,{"className":"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 sm:py-20","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-3","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"lg:col-span-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-[family-name:var(--font-display)] text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[var(--color-navy)] mb-6","children":["About ","Vision Express"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed text-base","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"Vision Express is a major UK optical chain owned by the EssilorLuxottica group, one of the world's largest eyewear companies. They offer a comprehensive range of eye tests, glasses, sunglasses, and contact lenses, with a strong emphasis on clinical excellence. Many of their stores are located in prominent high-street and retail park locations, and they carry an extensive portfolio of premium and designer frames."}],[["$","p","0",{"children":"Vision Express was founded in 1988 in Gateshead, Tyne and Wear, with a mission to provide high-quality eye care and fashionable eyewear on the British high street. The company expanded rapidly during the 1990s, opening stores in major town centres and retail parks across England, Scotland, Wales, and Northern Ireland. Its strategy of securing prominent retail locations — often with large, well-lit showrooms — helped it stand out from traditional opticians and attract a customer base interested in eyewear as much as a fashion accessory as a medical necessity."}],["$","p","1",{"children":"In 2013, Vision Express was acquired by GrandVision, a Dutch optical retail group that operated thousands of stores worldwide. This acquisition provided Vision Express with greater purchasing power and access to a broader range of lens technology. The ownership changed again in 2021 when EssilorLuxottica — the global eyewear giant formed from the 2018 merger of French lens maker Essilor and Italian frame manufacturer Luxottica — completed its purchase of GrandVision. This made Vision Express a sister company to other well-known brands in the EssilorLuxottica portfolio, including Sunglass Hut and LensCrafters."}],["$","p","2",{"children":"Today, Vision Express operates around 400 stores across the UK and is known for its emphasis on clinical quality and advanced eye care technology. The chain has invested heavily in equipping its stores with OCT scanning and digital retinal photography, and it positions itself as a premium optician offering designer frames alongside comprehensive eye health assessments. Vision Express also offers a price match guarantee and a 30-day satisfaction guarantee on glasses, reflecting its confidence in both product quality and customer service."}]]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-200 h-fit","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-[family-name:var(--font-display)] text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--color-navy)] mb-4","children":"Quick Facts"}],["$","dl",null,{"className":"space-y-3 text-sm","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex justify-between","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-gray-500","children":"Founded"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"font-medium text-[var(--color-navy)]","children":"1988"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex justify-between","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-gray-500","children":"UK Stores"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"font-medium text-[var(--color-navy)]","children":"400"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex justify-between","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-gray-500","children":"Price Range"}],"$L14"]}],"$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19"]}]]}]]}]}]
