rement for glaucoma screening, and a detailed examination of the health of your eyes. Vision Express optometrists use advanced digital imaging equipment alongside traditional clinical techniques."}]}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-6 py-4","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-navy)]","children":"Free (if eligible)"}]}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-6 py-4","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-500","children":"20-25 minutes"}]}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-6 py-4 text-center","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"inline-flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-success)]/10","children":["$","svg",null,{"className":"w-4 h-4 text-[var(--color-success)]","fill":"currentColor","viewBox":"0 0 20 20","children":["$","path",null,{"fillRule":"evenodd","d":"M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z","clipRule":"evenodd"}]}]}]}]]}],["$","tr","1",{"className":"hover:bg-gray-50/50 transition-colors","children":[["$","td",null,{"className":"px-6 py-4","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm font-medium text-[var(--color-navy)]","children":"Private Eye Test"}]}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-6 py-4","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-500","children":"A comprehensive eye examination for patients not eligible for NHS funding. The test covers all the same clinical assessments as the NHS test, with the addition of more time for discussion of visual needs and lifestyle factors that may influence your lens and frame choices. Vision Express private tests include a detailed report of your eye health."}]}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-6 py-4","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--color-navy)]","children":"From £30"}]}],["$","td",null,{"className":"px-6 py-4","children":["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm text-gray-500","children":"25